      "en": "But if you refuse to go out, this is the word that the LORD has shown me:",
      "ko": "그러나 만일 항복하기를 거절하시면 여호와께서 내게 보이신 말씀대로 되리이다",
      "source_text_hash": "b6a77620be1aa727fa3c7d1f2f680392311af47dfff54f8652138d16c33dfafd",
      "translation_text_hash": "978acc423e94f18a24562a1d87fd9b53725300dda669916da50e54affd4edd8e",
